{"unit_id":"ayst-z__music-code-mv#card-zh","repo":"ayst-z/music-code-mv","commit":"d086896da31b6563a73415d82005bb83b82cdd34","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-music-code-mv 是一款 DSH 音乐视频创作插件，可把分镜工程渲染成确定性的逐帧动画。它向 DSH 注册创作指南、环境检查、工程初始化、渲染、歌词写入、帧对比和 MV 工坊工具，并提供 Web 客户端界面。用户可以从模板和风格预设起步，生成联系表、静帧或 MP4，也可查看工程与渲染状态。适合希望用 Canvas2D 或 Three.js 代码制作可重复音乐视频的创作者。渲染需要本机图形/浏览器工具链与 ffmpeg；插件支持配置可执行文件路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:254-310","index.js:396-588","lib/client.js:1760-1794","skill/scripts/render.mjs:1-35"]}
{"unit_id":"ayst-z__music-code-mv#card-en","repo":"ayst-z/music-code-mv","commit":"d086896da31b6563a73415d82005bb83b82cdd34","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-music-code-mv turns storyboards into deterministic music videos. Its DSH tools set up projects, render contact sheets, stills or MP4, inject lyrics and compare frames. A web MV Studio shows projects and render status. It suits creators making reproducible Canvas2D or Three.js animations.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:254-310","index.js:396-588","lib/client.js:1760-1794","skill/scripts/render.mjs:1-35"]}
